[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "結局、ララに伝えたのね。クリセルダのこと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So you ended up telling Lara about Criselda after all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "伝えないと、面倒なことになりそうだったからよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I had to. It looked like things could get messy if I didn't."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クリセルダのこと、止めるつもり？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you planning to stop her?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しないわよ、そんなこと。\nレースに手出ししないなら私には関係ないから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course not. As long as she doesn't interfere with the race, it's none of my business."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今はね、あんたやレスナたちとの勝負のほうに\n集中したいの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right now, I want to focus on my match against you and the others."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I see."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本選……楽しみね。私も、全力を尽くすわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The finals... I'm looking forward to it. I'll give it everything I have too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "当たり前よ。手を抜かれても張り合いがないじゃない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Obviously. It wouldn't be any fun if you held back on me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねえ……私たちの関係性ってなんなのかしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Say... what exactly is our relationship?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どういう意味よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What do you mean by that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いわゆる……友達だったり？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are we... friends, perhaps?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ！？\u3000私とあんたが！？\nそんなわけないじゃない！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?! You and me?! Don't be ridiculous!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、こうして貴方とレースに参加してて……\n戦うのは、悪い気持ちじゃないって思ったの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But being here with you, participating in this race... competing against you doesn't feel bad at all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私がこんな気持ちになるなんて\n思っても見なかったわ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I never thought I'd feel this way..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……よく分かんないけど。\n強いて言うなら、好敵手ってやつじゃない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I don't really get it. But if I had to put a name to it, I guess we're rivals."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "好敵手……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rivals..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうね。貴方はきっと、好敵手だわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. You're definitely my rival."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから明日は絶対、あんたには負けないわ。\nううん、誰にだって負けない。１位になるんだから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's why I absolutely won't lose to you tomorrow. No, I won't lose to anyone. I'm taking first place!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……私だって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Neither will I."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クリセルダはもう邪魔しないって言ってた。\nだから、これが正真正銘本当の勝負よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda said she wouldn't interfere anymore. So this will be our real, honest competition."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "決着を付けましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's settle this once and for all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "望むところ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wouldn't have it any other way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]